  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mo>&#8757;</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> are inverse function of each other<br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Now put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>5</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math>"
  }
